title: The Bookseller
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: bookseller

bookseller: Rare books! Rare... um... other stuff!
seeker: Anything good?
bookseller: I suppose that depends on what you buy. And your luck.
bookseller: I've got a few things you might be interested in...

choice:
  - [if gold >= 75] Take a random rare card, for 75 gold -> buy
  - I'll pay you 100 gold to take this from me... -> curse
  - Politely decline and walk away -> leave

@buy
  > gold -75
  > card add random rare
  bookseller: Hope that helps on your journey!
  > end

@curse
  > gold 100
  > curse injury
  bookseller: Sorry I should have mentioned it had sharp edges.
  > end

@leave
  bookseller: Guess I'll carry these around a bit longer.
  > end
